;
;  Let's implement a generic horizontal slider in BASIC!
;
;  We need some information to do this:
;
;  sl$    = the label variable
;  sn%    = the number of items to choose from
;  si$(n) = an array of items
;  sl%    = the current selected item
;  sr$    = the result variable
;
{:run horizontal slider}
   for x = 1 to sn%
;
;  Hey we also need to print the open/closed circle thingy
;
      ? si$(n);
   next x
;
;  Now read from the keyboard and move the cursor
;  between items, and detect <return> to return the
;  current value
;   
return
